compensationdelay audio filter (src/audio/compensationdelay.ts)

src/audio/compensationdelay.ts adapts FFmpeg libavfilter/af_compensationdelay.c:
the option table (mm, cm, m, dry, wet, temp with their defaults and ranges), the
COMP_DELAY_SOUND_SPEED_KM_H / COMP_DELAY_SOUND_SPEED_CM_S /
COMP_DELAY_SOUND_FRONT_DELAY macros in their evaluation order, config_input's
delay computation truncated to unsigned, and filter_frame's write-then-read
delay line dst = dry * x + wet * buffer[r_ptr] in the pinned dblp format.

Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
